msgid "Constraints"
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/algebra.md:16
msgid "MoonBit traits have one `Self` parameter and no associated types, so a trait cannot name the scalar type of a vector or matrix."
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/algebra.md:18
msgid "MoonBit has no type-level naturals, so dimensions are runtime values and shape mismatches cannot be rejected by the type checker."
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/algebra.md:20
msgid "The package must not import any concrete type, so that external libraries can implement the traits without depending on `immut` or `mutable`."
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/algebra.md:22
msgid "The traits must reuse MoonBit's operator traits (`Add`, `Neg`, `Sub`, `Mul`) so that implementations keep their `+`, `-` and `*` syntax."
msgstr ""

#: manual/design/algebra.md:25
#: manual/design/arithmetic.md:22
#: manual/design/backends/default.md:20
#: manual/design/consistency.md:19
#: manual/design/container.md:21
#: manual/design/container/adapters.md:19
